               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <title>Uses</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>FIRST AID WOUND WASH TO PREVENT INFECTION IN MINOR: WOUNDS, CUTS, SCRAPES AND BURNS. GENTLY REMOVES DIRT AND DEBRIS; HELPS PREVENT MINOR SKIN INFECTION</paragraph>
               </text>
