               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <title>Directions</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Clean affected area by thoroughly spraying it 1 to 3 times a day, oras needed to relieve symptoms, Cover with a bandage if needed. 
  <br/>  Safe on sensitive skin. May be used in conjunction with Sovereign Silver Homeopathic First Aid Gel.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250613"/>
            </section>
